Temple4 License Notice
======================

Temple4 project files are licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or later.

This covers the Temple4 build scripts, project documentation, project-specific
configuration, and Temple4 branding assets in this repository, except where a
file or directory clearly states a different license.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

Third-party components
----------------------

This repository and the generated Temple4 ISO include third-party free software
components from Debian GNU/Linux, GNU, Linux-libre, GRUB, Syslinux, QEMU-related
payloads, and other upstream projects. Those components are not relicensed by
Temple4. They remain under their original upstream licenses.

In particular:

- Linux-libre is based on the Linux kernel and is distributed under GPL-2.0.
- Debian packages are distributed under their individual package licenses.
- GNU components are distributed under their individual GNU project licenses.
- Bootloader files, package payloads, ISOs, and other bundled artifacts retain
  their upstream license terms.

For installed package license details in a built system, see package copyright
files under:

    /usr/share/doc/*/copyright

Common license texts are normally available in:

    /usr/share/common-licenses

Source availability
-------------------

Temple4 is an aggregate distribution image assembled from free software
components. When distributing Temple4 ISO images, provide access to this source
repository and to the corresponding upstream source packages for included
third-party components, as required by their licenses.

Debian source packages can be retrieved with Debian tooling such as:

    apt source <package-name>

Linux-libre source is available from the GNU/Linux-libre project and its
published mirrors.
